This is a tough call, because you really want EVERYTHING.  Although 
weapons and armor are the normal choices, you should also consider 
that they are fairly easily available.  Once you find an alter, 
you'll be able to get that frostbrand with some work.  You might
also want to consider wishing for some of the more rare things:

- blessed +3 gauntlets of power (especially if you're weak)
- blessed amulet of life saving (especially if you type too fast)
- ring of conflict (if you can already deal with monsters 1 on 1)
- blessed +3 pair of speed boots (although they are armor, the real
     benefit is the extra speed)

